{
 "name": "audius-studio",
 "displayName": "Audius Studio DAW",
 "baseUrl": "http://127.0.0.1:3000",
 "description": "The Audius Studio browser DAW (repo DOGECOIN87/DAW) as an API. Needs the local server (npm start) and, for tier-3 session operations, one open DAW tab whose bridge is connected (GET /api/sessions). Write operations change the live session and need --allow-writes, as in api-anything. The native API (POST /api/call, tools/daw-api, app/api/mcp.mjs) exposes ~50 operations; this spec is a starter set.",
